{"game":{"display_name":"準決勝第二試合","duration_seconds":86094,"game_id":12,"game_type":"multiplayer","is_public":true,"main_players":[],"problem":{"description":"標準入力の各行に、ガラケーのトグル入力を模した数字列が与えられます。\r\n以下のキー配置に従って、入力された数字列を対応するひらがなに変換して出力してください。\r\n\r\nキー配置:\r\n\r\n- 1: あいうえお\r\n- 2: かきくけこ\r\n- 3: さしすせそ\r\n- 4: たちつてと\r\n- 5: なにぬねの\r\n- 6: はひふへほ\r\n- 7: まみむめも\r\n- 8: やゆよ\r\n- 9: らりるれろ\r\n- 0: わをん\r\n\r\n同じキーを連続して押すと文字が切り替わります（1回目で1番目の文字、2回目で2番目の文字…）。\r\n割り当て文字数を超えた場合は先頭に戻ります（例: キー8を4回押すと「や」）。\r\n異なるキーが押された時点で、一つ前の文字が確定します。\r\n今回のテストケースでは、同じ行の文字を連続して打つことはありません（「うえ」や「かき」が答えになることはないものとします）。\r\nまた、上記の表にない文字（小さい「ゃ」「ゅ」「ょ」「っ」や「ー」、濁音半濁音など）も考慮する必要はありません。\r\n\r\nすべての行についてこの手順を繰り返してください。\r\n\r\n入力例:\r\n32229\r\n2222200055446\r\n\r\n出力例:\r\nさくら\r\nこんにちは\r\n","language":"php","problem_id":12,"sample_code":"<?php\r\nconst KANA_TABLE = [\r\n    1 => 'あいうえお', 2 => 'かきくけこ', 3 => 'さしすせそ',\r\n    4 => 'たちつてと', 5 => 'なにぬねの', 6 => 'はひふへほ',\r\n    7 => 'まみむめも', 8 => 'やゆよ',     9 => 'らりるれろ',\r\n    0 => 'わをん',\r\n];\r\nwhile (($s = fgets(STDIN)) !== false) {\r\n    $s = trim($s);\r\n    $result = '';\r\n    $i = 0;\r\n    $len = strlen($s);\r\n    while ($i < $len) {\r\n        $key = $s[$i];\r\n        $count = 0;\r\n        while ($i < $len && $s[$i] === $key) {\r\n            $count++;\r\n            $i++;\r\n        }\r\n        $chars = KANA_TABLE[(int)$key];\r\n        $idx = ($count - 1) % mb_strlen($chars);\r\n        $result .= mb_substr($chars, $idx, 1);\r\n    }\r\n    echo $result . \"\\n\";\r\n}\r\n\r\n","title":"トグル入力","sample_code_html":"<pre class=\"shiki github-light\" style=\"background-color:#fff;color:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x3C;?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">php</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> KANA_TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'あいうえお'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'かきくけこ'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'さしすせそ'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    4</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'たちつてと'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'なにぬねの'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">6</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'はひふへほ'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    7</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'まみむめも'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">8</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'やゆよ'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'らりるれろ'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\"> =></span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> 'わをん'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> (($s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> fgets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">STDIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    $s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> trim</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">($s);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    $result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    $i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    $len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> strlen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">($s);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> ($i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $len) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        $key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $s[$i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        $count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> ($i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $s[$i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $key) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            $count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">            $i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        $chars </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> KANA_TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">[(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">)$key];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        $idx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> ($count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> mb_strlen</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">($chars);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">        $result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">.=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\"> mb_substr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">($chars, $idx, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\"> $result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49\">.</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},"started_at":1774083905}}
